        "content": "<p>Byte-Naut opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14681\">PR #14681</a> from <code>Byte-Naut:issue-14241-tests-cleanup</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Follow-up to #14620, per <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14620#discussion_r4250309209\">this review comment</a>.</p>\n<p>These tests built broken scheduler states by hand to exercise internal-error paths, which ties them to <code>concurrent.rs</code> internals that change often. They were mainly useful for checking the fix in #14620 against the unpatched paths. <code>thread-wait-resume.wast</code> is kept.</p>\n<p>Developed with assistance from Claude (Anthropic). Per the Bytecode Alliance AI Tool Use Policy, I'm the author and accountable for this change.</p>\n</blockquote>",
